    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Currently, art museums struggle to engage pre-literate audiences and facilitate parent-child interactions. TandemArt is a web app for joint media engagement between pre-literate children and their parents in art museums. The app facilitates interactions with the art in an engaging, playful way that fosters interest in art and art creation as well as assists in developing age-appropriate skills. In order to gauge learning, we coded for joint media engagement behaviors as well as observed users and collected parent feedback while testing the app.",
            "type": "abstract",
            "identifier": [],
            "note": [],
            "appliesTo": []
        }
